Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.87,0:01:18.54,OP_CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(1245.284,1026)}{\fad(90,90)}時
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.30,0:00:00.30,OP_CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,--13--
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.49,0:01:21.25,OP_CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(896.604,1026)}{\fad(90,90)}目
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.54,0:01:21.30,OP_CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1026)}{\fad(90,90)}送
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.59,0:01:21.35,OP_CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(1023.396,1026)}{\fad(90,90)}著
